     "author": {
      "accountId": "6089a55c52a3d400690692f7",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/6089a55c52a3d400690692f7/7a62c587-b0f1-4cd4-982c-21b3837dc64a/16",
       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/6089a55c52a3d400690692f7/7a62c587-b0f1-4cd4-982c-21b3837dc64a/24",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/6089a55c52a3d400690692f7/7a62c587-b0f1-4cd4-982c-21b3837dc64a/32",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/6089a55c52a3d400690692f7/7a62c587-b0f1-4cd4-982c-21b3837dc64a/48"
      },
      "displayName": "Ralf Claussnitzer",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a55c52a3d400690692f7",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Usage of `org.modeshape.jcr.security.AuthenticationProvider` can be found in the `fcrepo-auth-common module`. I assume this is the `f4-auth` JIRA-component? And additional interface type similar to this has to be defined in `fcrepo-kernel-api`, wrapping all of the used Modeshape types?",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "This is bigger than the description suggests. The `fcrepo-auth-common` module depends on `modeshape-jcr` and `modeshape-web-jcr` (plus `fcrepo-kernel-modeshape` for testing).",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Not sure whether just wrapping all Modeshape types really accomplishes something. A naive approach would probably lead to a shallow copy of the Modeshape API itself. ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
